"48463418", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118440953866313882"], "id": "2118440953866313882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 253, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your physics journey is bigger with the right community behind you. Connect with physicists, share your research and discover new opportunities with APS. https://t.co/yeBBKgY5oa https://t.co/uB3ydtmbNS", "url": "https://x.com/APSphysics/status/2118440953866313882"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:20:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118438396951441889"], "id": "2118438396951441889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 61, "impression_count": 16930, "like_count": 151, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "THE MARKET IS SELLING OFF FOR REAL\n\nIn today's newsletter, I wrote a few scattered thoughts about stocks, bonds, the election, the blowup of the \"Long California/Short Texas\" trade, and whether the data centers of the future will be built in outer space or Malaysia. https://t.co/L1GvD6GhW9", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2118438396951441889"}, {"author_id": "30034124", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:19:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118437953861025921"], "id": "2118437953861025921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 327, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "At a recent event at Fermilab, leaders from national laboratories and industry explored how the @energy national labs’ expertise and facilities could help address fusion’s most critical challenges.\nhttps://t.co/6ATLNqbUMB", "url": "https://x.com/Fermilab/status/2118437953861025921"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:09:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118435558372573277"], "id": "2118435558372573277", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_coun